[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7943.83, "timestamp": "02:12:23", "text": "[笑聲] 呃，我不知道該怎麼做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7950.629, "timestamp": "02:12:30", "text": "該死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7951.83, "timestamp": "02:12:31", "text": "你打算如何結束這一切？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7952.149, "timestamp": "02:12:32", "text": "該死的。  媽的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7956.149, "timestamp": "02:12:36", "text": "等等，到底該如何交朋友呢？  該死的。等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7957.669, "timestamp": "02:12:37", "text": "我試試。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7964.629, "timestamp": "02:12:44", "text": "呃，你之前寄過一張賀卡，對吧？好的，我會盡量傳給你。  等待。哦，明白了。"}]